{"seq":1,"slug":"withholding-base-rate-determination","title":"代扣基数与税率确定：成交额、佣金、运费与市场税","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/withholding-calculation-collection/withholding-base-rate-determination","wordCount":3005,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"代扣基数与税率确定-成交额-佣金-运费与市场税\">代扣基数与税率确定：成交额、佣金、运费与市场税</h1><p>当平台从一笔订单里&quot;代扣&quot;两笔性质完全不同的钱时，基数确定就成了工程实现的第一个岔路口：一笔是代替税局向买家征收的流转税（VAT/GST/sales tax），另一笔是面向卖家的所得税信息报送与预扣（1099-K 与 backup withholding）。它们的计税基数<strong>不是同一个数</strong>，把两者混用一个 <code>gross_amount</code> 字段，是这类系统最常见、也最难事后修复的对账缺陷。本文拆解这两套基数在成交额、佣金、运费、市场税上的口径差异，给出可持续演进的税率确定管道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两类代扣-两套基数\">核心概念：两类代扣，两套基数</h2><p>流转税代扣的基数是<strong>买方向供应商支付的对价</strong>；所得税报送的基数是<strong>平台向卖家支付的总额</strong>。前者关心&quot;这笔货卖了多少钱&quot;，后者关心&quot;这笔钱给了谁、给了多少&quot;。同一次结算在两张报表上会出现四个不同的金额锚点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  O[订单成交额&lt;br/&gt;Item Price] --&gt; S[运费与手续费&lt;br/&gt;Shipping / Handling]&#10;  O --&gt; T[市场税&lt;br/&gt;Marketplace Tax]&#10;  S --&gt; VB[流转税基&lt;br/&gt;VAT/GST/Sales Base]&#10;  T --&gt; VB&#10;  O --&gt; VB&#10;  VB --&gt; TX[代扣税款&lt;br/&gt;Withheld Tax]&#10;  O --&gt; GA[1099-K Gross Amount&lt;br/&gt;Box 1a]&#10;  S --&gt; GA&#10;  T --&gt; GA&#10;  GA --&gt; FEE[平台佣金&lt;br/&gt;Commission]&#10;  FEE --&gt; PO[卖家净打款&lt;br/&gt;Seller Payout]&#10;  GA --&gt; PO\">graph TD\n  O[订单成交额&lt;br/&gt;Item Price] --&gt; S[运费与手续费&lt;br/&gt;Shipping / Handling]\n  O --&gt; T[市场税&lt;br/&gt;Marketplace Tax]\n  S --&gt; VB[流转税基&lt;br/&gt;VAT/GST/Sales Base]\n  T --&gt; VB\n  O --&gt; VB\n  VB --&gt; TX[代扣税款&lt;br/&gt;Withheld Tax]\n  O --&gt; GA[1099-K Gross Amount&lt;br/&gt;Box 1a]\n  S --&gt; GA\n  T --&gt; GA\n  GA --&gt; FEE[平台佣金&lt;br/&gt;Commission]\n  FEE --&gt; PO[卖家净打款&lt;br/&gt;Seller Payout]\n  GA --&gt; PO</pre><p>关键差异用下表对齐，工程上必须分别落库、分别可追溯：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>流转税代扣基数（VAT/GST/Sales Tax）</th>\n<th>1099-K 报送基数（Box 1a gross amount）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成交额</td>\n<td>计入（Art 73 对价）</td>\n<td>计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费/包装/保险</td>\n<td><strong>计入</strong>（Art 78(b) 附带费用）</td>\n<td><strong>计入</strong>（不做扣减）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场代收税款</td>\n<td>计入（Art 78(a) 除 VAT 本身外的税费）</td>\n<td>计入（&quot;any other amounts&quot; 不扣减）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台佣金</td>\n<td><strong>不从中扣除</strong>（是平台对卖家的独立服务供给）</td>\n<td><strong>不扣除</strong>（不因 fees 调减）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款</td>\n<td>有效折扣/退货按发生时点冲减</td>\n<td><strong>不冲减</strong>（退款交易仅不计入 Box 3 笔数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折扣/优惠券</td>\n<td>成交时生效者冲减对价</td>\n<td>不因 discounts 调减</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>依据：欧盟 VAT 指令第 73 条把基数定义为&quot;供应商就供给所取得或应取得的一切对价&quot;，第 78 条明确把&quot;供应商向客户收取的佣金、包装、运输和保险等附带费用&quot;计入；而美国 IRS 2026 年 12 月版 1099-K 说明书写明 Box 1a 是&quot;total reportable payment transactions&quot;的年度总额，<strong>不考虑 credits、cash equivalents、discounts、fees、refunds、shipping 或任何其他金额的调整</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成交额与代扣基数-vat-gst-的对价口径\">成交额与代扣基数：VAT/GST 的对价口径</h2><p>流转税基数的第一原则是<strong>对价（consideration）<strong>而非&quot;发票金额&quot;。欧盟 VAT 指令第 73 条规定基数涵盖供应商从客户</strong>或第三方</strong>取得的一切对价，并显式包含&quot;与供给价格直接相关的补贴&quot;——这意味着平台的补贴、优惠券出资方、政府补贴都要判断是否进入基数。</p>\n<p>对价还要处理两个方向的修正：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>折扣的方向</strong>：在供给时点已生效的价格折扣直接冲减对价（例如页面标价即已打折）；供给后才发生的返利（rebate、成交量返佣）不冲减基数，而是作为独立的费用处理。工程上这要求订单快照记录&quot;结算时点的有效单价&quot;，而不是事后再用月度返利表回算。</li>\n<li><strong>退款的时点</strong>：退货或退款发生时，按 VAT 指令第 90 条可相应调减基数；但对 1099-K，退款<strong>不冲减</strong> Box 1a，只从 Box 3 的交易笔数中剔除。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>基数在税率之前，因此基数错误会放大到税额。用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 表示基数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 表示适用税率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 表示代扣税款：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = B \\times r = \\left( P + S + X \\right) \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为商品对价、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为附带费用（运费/包装/保险）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 为计入基数的其他税费。1099-K 口径则是独立的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = P + S + X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 不再减去佣金 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 只出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G - C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的卖家打款计算里，永远不回头修改 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"佣金与费用-能不能从代扣基数里扣掉\">佣金与费用：能不能从代扣基数里扣掉</h2><p>这是实践中最容易被产品需求&quot;顺手优化&quot;错的地方。平台想当然地认为&quot;卖家实际到手才是应税收入，所以按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P - C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 申报/征税&quot;——这在两套基数上都是错的，而且方向相反地错。</p>\n<p>对流转税：平台佣金是<strong>平台向卖家提供的服务</strong>，是一次独立的应税供给，与&quot;平台向买家供给货物&quot;是两笔交易。把它塞进货物基数做净额，等于让货物供给的计税对价失真，同时还会漏掉平台自身服务费应纳的税。欧盟第 78(b) 条说的&quot;佣金计入&quot;指的是<strong>供应商向客户收取的</strong>佣金（如货到付款手续费），不是卖家付给平台的佣金。方向必须分清：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>费用方向</th>\n<th>举例</th>\n<th>是否进入流转税基数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>供应商 → 客户 收取</td>\n<td>代收手续费、包装费、保险费</td>\n<td><strong>进入</strong>（Art 78(b)）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家 → 平台 支付</td>\n<td>平台佣金、广告费、仓储费</td>\n<td>不进入货物基数（是平台服务对价）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方 → 供应商 支付</td>\n<td>与价格直接挂钩的补贴</td>\n<td>进入（Art 73）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对 1099-K：Box 1a 明确&quot;不因 fees 调减&quot;，平台佣金留在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 内。这也是为什么卖家常发现自己&quot;到手 800 却报了 1000&quot;——报送基数按总流水，费用要到 Schedule C 上作为支出抵扣，是两件事。</p>\n<p>工程结论：<strong>结算账本必须同时保留 gross、fee、net 三个字段，且每个字段标注它服务于哪套基数</strong>。任何降级为单字段 <code>amount</code> 的设计，都会在第一个多辖区的对账周期里暴露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运费-市场税与-可分别列示\">运费、市场税与&quot;可分别列示&quot;</h2><p>运费是否随商品一起计税，美国各州口径割裂，而英国/欧盟的口径又不同，这是税率管道必须按辖区分支的典型原因。</p>\n<p>英国 gov.uk 对 £135 以下、由境外卖家直发 GB 消费者的货物规定：卖家在销售时点征收英国供给 VAT；而在判断 £135 进口门槛时，用<strong>内在价值（intrinsic value）</strong>——即货物售价，<strong>不含</strong>运输或保险成本（除非已含在价格中且未在发票上单独列示），也不含其他可识别的税费。这产生一个反直觉的组合：运费可能<strong>不</strong>影响进口门槛判定，却<strong>要</strong>进入英国供给 VAT 的计税基数。</p>\n<p>美国方向则相反地碎片化。以肯塔基州为例：当应税商品的实际卖家负责配送时运费应税，handling（操作费）始终应税，而合并列示的 shipping &amp; handling 无论由谁配送都应税；多个州则允许分别列示的运费免税。这类&quot;可分别列示即免税&quot;的规则，把<strong>发票的数据结构</strong>变成了税务正确性的一部分——如果系统把运费与商品合并成一行 <code>line_total</code>，就永久失去了适用免税规则的资格。</p>\n<p>市场税（marketplace tax）方向同理。IRS 不因为它叫&quot;税&quot;就从 1099-K 基数里剔除：2026 版说明书用的是&quot;without regard to ... or any other amounts&quot;的兜底措辞，任何非列举项都不做扣减。而流转税基数侧，第 78(a) 条把&quot;除 VAT 本身以外的税费、关税、捐费&quot;计入基数，因此在美国由平台代收的 sales tax 通常不进入流转税基数（它是税不是对价），但在欧盟除 VAT 自身以外的其他税费要计入——同名字段在不同辖区语义相反，必须由辖区规则显式声明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"税率确定-管辖判定-版本化与查找\">税率确定：管辖判定、版本化与查找</h2><p>基数定下来后，税率确定的难点从&quot;算多少&quot;变成&quot;用哪一版算&quot;。第 78 条给出的标准税率下界是 15%（无上限），各国可另有最多两档低至 5% 的优惠税率、一档低于 5% 的超低税率与零税率（限七类基本需求品），以及不低于 12% 的 parking rate；这些结构来自 2022 年 4 月理事会指令 (EU) 2022/542 的改革。美国侧则是 45 州以上的 destination-based 税率叠加地方税（州、county、city、special district）。</p>\n<p>税率查找管道的三个工程约束：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>判据是目的地而非发货地</strong>。流转税的连接点由&quot;货物最终交付地&quot;决定，而非卖家注册地或仓库地。欧盟对欧盟内远程销售的 10 000 欧元全欧统一门槛，就记录在 VAT 指令第 59c(1)(c) 条，跨过它意味着卖家在买家所在国就负有纳税义务，平台代扣的判据也随之切换。</li>\n<li><strong>税率必须带生效日期版本</strong>。税率变更常见于年初或立法生效日，且常带过渡条款。若税率表只有 <code>rate</code> 字段而无 <code>effective_from</code> / <code>effective_to</code>，历史订单重算会得到与当时不一致的结果。</li>\n<li><strong>优先规则与豁免先于税率查找</strong>。商品的分类（是否属于优惠税率品类、是否属于免税的数字化供给）决定先命中哪条税率，再由地理精确到 street-level 的税率表给出最终值。顺序错误会让&quot;正确的地理 + 错误的品类&quot;静默产生错误税额。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现-确定性代扣管道\">工程实现：确定性代扣管道</h2><p>把上述规则固化成一条<strong>从订单快照到代扣分录</strong>的确定性管道，是让多辖区税务可审计的前提。管道每一步都只读上游、产出不可变记录：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单快照&lt;br/&gt;line items + 目的地 + 时点] --&gt; B[品类与辖区判定&lt;br/&gt;classification + jurisdiction]&#10;  B --&gt; C[基数组装&lt;br/&gt;P + S + X]&#10;  C --&gt; D[税率解析&lt;br/&gt;rate lookup + 生效版本]&#10;  D --&gt; E[税额计算&lt;br/&gt;round + 舍入规则]&#10;  E --&gt; F[代扣分录&lt;br/&gt;immutable ledger entry]&#10;  F --&gt; G[对账&lt;br/&gt;reconciliation vs payout]\">graph TD\n  A[订单快照&lt;br/&gt;line items + 目的地 + 时点] --&gt; B[品类与辖区判定&lt;br/&gt;classification + jurisdiction]\n  B --&gt; C[基数组装&lt;br/&gt;P + S + X]\n  C --&gt; D[税率解析&lt;br/&gt;rate lookup + 生效版本]\n  D --&gt; E[税额计算&lt;br/&gt;round + 舍入规则]\n  E --&gt; F[代扣分录&lt;br/&gt;immutable ledger entry]\n  F --&gt; G[对账&lt;br/&gt;reconciliation vs payout]</pre><p>三条落地纪律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基数组装在行级完成，不在地单级做净额</strong>。每行保留 <code>item_price</code>、<code>shipping</code>、<code>handling</code>、<code>other_charges</code> 独立字段，再按辖区规则求和为基数。行级保留是唯一能同时满足&quot;美国某些州运费免税&quot;与&quot;英国运费进基数&quot;的数据形状。</li>\n<li><strong>舍入规则按辖区声明并全局一致</strong>。分币舍入必须定义在&quot;行 × 税率&quot;还是&quot;单 × 税率&quot;层级，且一条订单内不可混用；否则跨月对账会出现无法解释的零星差额。</li>\n<li><strong>预扣（backup withholding）是独立的第三笔钱</strong>。当卖家未按 IRS 要求提供 TIN 时，付款方须按 <strong>24% 的统一税率</strong>预扣（IRS Tax Topic 307，2026 年 9 月更新），该金额报送在 1099-K 的 Box 4。它与流转税代扣、与 1099-K 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 都不同源，必须走独立的预扣分录，不能合并进任何一侧的基数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个可核验的金额核对等式因此收敛为三条互不干扰的管线：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>vat</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>jurisdiction</mtext></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>；</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1099</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>；</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>backup</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1099</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>仅在 TIN 缺失时</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{vat}} = (P + S + X)\\times r_{\\text{jurisdiction}} \\quad\\text{；}\\quad G_{1099} = P + S + X \\quad\\text{；}\\quad W_{\\text{backup}} = 24\\% \\times G_{1099}\\ (\\text{仅在 TIN 缺失时})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">jurisdiction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">；</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1099</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">；</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">backup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1099</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">仅在</span><span class=\"mord\"> TIN </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缺失时</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>卖家打款则为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1099</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>vat</mtext><mtext>seller-borne</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>backup</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_{1099} - C - T_{\\text{vat}}^{\\text{seller-borne}} - W_{\\text{backup}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1099</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vat</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller-borne</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">backup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中哪些税负由卖家承担、哪些由买家承担，取决于辖区是否把代扣税款做成价外附加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流转税基数与 1099-K 报送基数是<strong>两个不同的数</strong>，前者锚定对价，后者锚定支付总额，必须分字段落库。</li>\n<li>欧盟 VAT 指令第 73/78 条把附带费用（佣金、包装、运输、保险）计入基数；IRS 1099-K Box 1a 对 fees、refunds、discounts、shipping 一律不调减。</li>\n<li>卖家付给平台的佣金<strong>不</strong>从任何一侧基数中净额扣除；方向判断错误会同时失真货物税基与平台自身服务税。</li>\n<li>运费与市场税的应税性按辖区分支，能否&quot;分别列示&quot;直接决定发票数据结构的设计下限。</li>\n<li>税率确定要处理管辖判定、生效日期版本化、品类优先规则三件事；税率表缺生效区间会导致历史重算不一致。</li>\n<li>backup withholding 按 24% 独立预扣，报送在 1099-K Box 4，与另两条管线互不合并。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章的下一节 <a href=\"../seller-reporting-1099/\">卖家报送与 1099 税表</a> 会从这些基数出发，展开面向税局的表单生成与年度报送流程。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代扣基数与税率确定：成交额、佣金、运费与市场税","id":"代扣基数与税率确定-成交额-佣金-运费与市场税"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两类代扣，两套基数","id":"核心概念-两类代扣-两套基数"},{"level":2,"text":"成交额与代扣基数：VAT/GST 的对价口径","id":"成交额与代扣基数-vat-gst-的对价口径"},{"level":2,"text":"佣金与费用：能不能从代扣基数里扣掉","id":"佣金与费用-能不能从代扣基数里扣掉"},{"level":2,"text":"运费、市场税与\"可分别列示\"","id":"运费-市场税与-可分别列示"},{"level":2,"text":"税率确定：管辖判定、版本化与查找","id":"税率确定-管辖判定-版本化与查找"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现：确定性代扣管道","id":"工程实现-确定性代扣管道"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商品可税性、税率来源与豁免品类分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/marketplace-facilitator-tax-model/product-taxability-exemption-classification"},"next":{"title":"税务引擎计算管线：地址校验、管辖来源与舍入幂等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/withholding-calculation-collection/tax-engine-address-sourcing-pipeline"}}